window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Three gripping historical romance novels, filled with excitement, family secrets, steamy bedroom scenes, and breathtaking love stories.</p> <p>Fall under the spell of a dark Highlander, thrill to forbidden kisses on windswept Dartmoor, and surrender to a mysterious count in the wild Carpathians.</p> <p>Experience intrigue and passion as you follow the adventures of Flora, Rosamund, and Sofia.</p> <p>Be prepared to listen well into the night!</p> <p>All three novels are self-contained.</p> <ul> <li>The Lady's Guide to a Highlander's Heart</li> <li>The Lady's Guide to Deception and Desire</li> <li>The Lady's Guide to Tempting a Transylvanian Count</li> </ul> <p>Brilliantly performed by British actor Gareth J Davies, and featuring sound effects.</p>"; 
